    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c77863fbec223be4a1ac5f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说菱亚马逊将会参加日本杯。\n而待兼诗歌剧则似乎会在日本杯前的\n“天皇赏（秋）”中出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9ef1ac0fbebaa5005644a61806b0d70dfad11766e21b49f3a0d8c40ba3874bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
