      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806f8dfa820b421a52b18131",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论在脑中模拟几次，\n都看不到赢过鲁道夫象征的可能性。\n成田白仁在黑暗中不断挣扎着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf13a30e3afedd502d3d3995d084a0e57ff765a91097a80a3d5f317dd59f112d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3adb9d33998d38b081a61c18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f174fca81b6cbc3ba6415cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她坦白了一切，但训练员以坚定的眼神回答，\n说她“一定能赢”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62775d5a7622f40f72743905d16b8c3443a1d6c64e931d6b58a206328b990045",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b8ecee1eb39aaa8c6d6a1f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48667a0481a7e21db395b5f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员的话使成田白仁又有了干劲。\n她想起训练员无时无刻\n都相信着自己会获胜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eadb8d4acd9269cab63d6fcc8aae6169b45da5013bda3872235c1f09df652033",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f940290edbe9e6517f7daf14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21e7bf67bfc35b4092795a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是在“日本杯”前的记者会上，\n成田白仁宣告自己将超越“皇帝”，\n并与鲁道夫象征坚定地握住了彼此的手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a833959b0802e38ccc1df7dc59566f1a8de8d66ab08644d26ad51d195d1687",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6715cc0b589497da9115691e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信任",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cd931be84cce03c36980c19ab5d579479eacf503a71ab6c8749c8826a960df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050a7faa03d5a86878b8a6ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光要退出第一线的传闻，\n近来在世间甚嚣尘上。\n而那个传闻令成田白仁愤恨不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4477531db418461ba7dbd9352342f7f5703026bb42534f94f726da9c45fbec70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45194949a220cf97488385c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她回想起姐姐过去的模样。\n姐姐至今仍未回到赛场，是代表她放弃了吗？\n白仁的心情大受影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98dd8d784f7f1ecbf14b2667f6452da820f2f66e4e8e7339eda5d68b8da57053",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2e64ddbe20b12e39927725b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，训练员的一句“真的是这样吗？”，\n让她回想起姐姐的强悍。\n她哭着决定要再次相信自己的姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbd55d9bba1ed872c2545b0629f7363e3ecbd94888beda9c0929f9d31e2fb600",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27aa422eb46f66ecfb0b23c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此刻，琵琶晨光正在医院拼命复健。\n为了回到赛场，\n她正不屈不挠地努力着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e1a23e86b016fe5a3e118e70861b5bea9347e00f5c9f7a2419d4db972155b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e71adbfed8cc55bea09cf96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "姐姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25622289ef32c86a55d884b5da82ad774d4f989f53b8ce7105659cd5317a20d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1e9c2f2aa91973c3855166",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光荣的称号“年度代表赛马娘”，\n这次由成田白仁获选。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3a467a8bfd3e3e80a9ff5489a8e98b995611dd0e8656b9cef19ad8b482c143",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f24ae70f6a161afa881b554",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "过去的得奖者也出席了表扬典礼。\n与身经百战的猛将交流应该会是很好的经验。\n但或许现在还太早了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a32628cacc468e589258ae0096cffd310ff91c5f7a7121e162e06b8a0c686bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377b1b26a4153b76d2ca23ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "期望与猛将们对决所以“出席”",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac11a2607fbf4ab0194fc7ed2e10588a02b5841556a6d2a3e05ebef5553d20f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f761ebe0740474f7667e23bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还没到那个阶段所以“不出席”",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a5b3075bf4db98dc6e3a96703f05956120e2c31e955f6de9d805462512df9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7460794135efe48aeff87fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要不要为了与强者相遇而出席呢？\n这项重大选择将决定她今后的路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d84c6c6a605f8f8c0125dc631b9f0bf872e14f4bb1120bb81cd748f1c399090",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
